[03:44.48]Some stories disappear, but they stay in the heart.
[03:47.98]Oh-oh, keep the light alive,
[03:49.94]Oh-oh, let the lost survive,
[03:52.16]Not in the numbers, not in the stone,
[03:54.44]But in every heart that refuses to forget.
